<style>
    body {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f7f6;
        color: #2d3436;
    }

    .terms-card {
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 16px;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        padding: 40px;
        margin-top: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 40px;
        border-top: 5px solid #007bff;
        /* Professional Blue Accent */
    }

    .policy-title {
        color: #007bff;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        text-align: center;
    }

    .last-update {
        text-align: center;
        color: #636e72;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .section-heading {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #212529;
        margin-top: 25px;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
    }

    .section-heading::before {
        content: "";
        width: 4px;
        height: 20px;
        background: #007bff;
        margin-right: 12px;
        border-radius: 2px;
    }

    /* Highlight Box for Legal Shield */
    .legal-shield {
        background-color: #e7f3ff;
        border-left: 5px solid #007bff;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #004085;
    }

    /* Highlight Box for Warning/Liability */
    .warning-box {
        background-color: #fff9db;
        border-left: 5px solid #fab005;
        padding: 15px;
        margin: 20px 0;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        color: #664d03;
    }

    .list-styled li {
        margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .footer-text {
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: #636e72;
        margin-top: 40px;
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
    }

    /* Mobile Optimizations */
    @media (max-width: 576px) {
        .terms-card {
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
        }
    }
</style>


<div class="container">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10 col-md-11">
            <div class="terms-card">

                <h1 class="policy-title">Terms and Conditions</h1>
                <p class="last-update">Last Updated: February 2026</p>

                <p class="lead text-center mb-4">Welcome to <strong>LocalTravelStay</strong>. By using this
                    platform, you agree to the following legally binding terms:</p>

                <hr>

                <div class="section-heading">1. Nature of Service (Pure Intermediary)</div>
                <p><strong>LocalTravelStay</strong> is a listing platform (aggregator) that connects customers with
                    independent vendors for rooms, car rentals, bike rentals, and restaurants.</p>
                <div class="legal-shield">
                    <strong>Legal Status:</strong> This platform is an <strong>‘Intermediary’ under Section
                        79</strong> of the Information Technology Act, 2000. We do not own, manage, or provide any
                    of the services listed. We are strictly a digital notice board.
                </div>

                <div class="section-heading">2. Direct Dealing & Liability</div>
                <ul class="list-styled">
                    <li><strong>Direct Interaction:</strong> All bookings, payments, and negotiations happen
                        directly between the customer and the vendor. The platform is NOT a party to these
                        transactions.</li>
                    <li><strong>No Guarantee:</strong> We do not guarantee the quality, safety, or condition of the
                        services (e.g., room cleanliness, vehicle condition, or food quality).</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="section-heading">3. Identity & Safety (KYC)</div>
                <p><strong>Verification:</strong> Users are advised to verify the Government ID (Aadhar, Driving
                    License, etc.) of the vendor/driver/hotel staff before engaging. The platform does not conduct
                    criminal background checks on vendors or users. <strong>Use services at your own risk.</strong>
                </p>

                <div class="section-heading">4. Incident Reporting & Legal Disputes</div>
                <div class="warning-box">
                    <strong>Misbehavior/Incidents:</strong> In case of any criminal activity, harassment,
                    misbehavior, or physical harm, the platform is <strong>NOT liable</strong>.
                </div>
                <p>The aggrieved party must approach the local police authorities directly. We will provide data
                    logs/records only if formally requested by legal authorities through a valid warrant or notice.
                </p>

                <div class="section-heading">5. Zero Tolerance Policy</div>
                <p>We maintain a <strong>Zero Tolerance Policy</strong> for misconduct. If a vendor or customer is
                    found guilty of fraud, misbehavior, or providing false information, we reserve the right to
                    <strong>Permanently Ban</strong> their account without prior notice.
                </p>

                <div class="section-heading">6. Specific Service Rules</div>
                <ul class="list-styled">
                    <li><strong>Family Only:</strong> Certain listings (especially in Mathura/Vrindavan) are
                        strictly for families. Vendors have the right to deny check-in to single persons.</li>
                    <li><strong>Amenities:</strong> Amenities like 'Cooler', 'Wi-Fi', etc., are provided by the
                        vendor. No compensation can be claimed from the platform for deficiencies.</li>
                    <li><strong>Check-out:</strong> Standard check-out is 10:00 AM unless otherwise agreed with the
                        vendor.</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="section-heading">7. Limitation of Liability</div>
                <p>LocalTravelStay shall not be held responsible for any loss, damage, accident, theft, or injury
                    arising from the use of services listed. Users agree to indemnify the platform against all such
                    claims.</p>

                <div class="footer-text">
                    <p>&copy; <%= year %> LocalTravelStay. All Rights Reserved.</p>
                    <p class="text-primary fw-bold">Tip: Always confirm booking details via call before arrival.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>